  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从图149中看出，长方形",
        "是这样得到的：把1平方分米",
        "的正方形分成$15(3\\cdot5=15)$",
        "等份并取其中的$8(2\\cdot4=8)$等",
        "份. 因此，长方形的面积等于$\\frac{8}{15}$",
        "平方分米. 在这种情况下，可以",
        "认为这个长方形的面积是用",
        "$\\frac{2}{3}$和$\\frac{4}{5}$相乘求得的："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 149",
      "box": [
        801,
        231,
        548,
        560
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-149"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 149",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{2\\cdot4}{3\\cdot5}=\\frac{8}{15}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是说，为了求出两个分数乘积的分子，必须使两个分数",
        "的分子相乘，而要求出两个分数乘积的分母，必须使两个分数",
        "的分母相乘."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**两个分数的乘积等于以两个分数的分子乘积为分子和以**",
        "**两个分数的分母乘积为分母的分数.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个法则也可以应用于自然数和分数相乘. 为此，只要",
        "把自然数化成分数再使用分数乘法法则就可以了."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如：",
        "$9\\cdot\\frac{6}{11}=\\frac{9}{1}\\cdot\\frac{6}{11}=\\frac{54}{11}=4\\frac{10}{11}$；$\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot7=\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot\\frac{7}{1}=\\frac{35}{8}=4\\frac{3}{8}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果两个分数的乘积是可约分数，最好先写成分子和分",
        "母分别相乘的形式，约简后，再相乘."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如：",
        "$\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot\\frac{14}{5}=\\frac{4\\cdot14}{7\\cdot5}=\\frac{4\\cdot2}{5}=\\frac{8}{5}=1\\frac{3}{5}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
